    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "All optimizer comparisons use momentum SGD, not plain SGD. Training permits up to 20 epochs with early stopping and selects checkpoints by validation accuracy. The reported split counts (2,125/375/2,500) contradict the stated 70/15/15 proportions; cross-validation uses the combined training and validation partition. Fold standard deviations do not establish significance of optimizer differences. No paired training-performance results establish whether poorer validation accuracy reflects optimization failure or a generalization difference."
